Z||000000||Jimmy||08-16-2001||04:36 PM||||Well, football season is here again!  In response to other forum members I have started a new thread for the 2001 season.  I hope this year of NFL is full of surprises and maybe, just maybe a superbowl appearance by my Vikes(they'll lose horribly in the final round of the playoffs  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> ).  <P>Well it looks like there are a couple preseason games tonight. My favs are the Jags and the Vikes, but who knows its preseason.  Its too bad players get injured in preseason. Levens, nuff said.<P>Anyway here is to a fun year of football, and hopefully another year full of good natured posts and a a little ribbing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Seems any other football messageboard is just fans talking sh!t on every post.  thats why I liked the old Tricky Buccaneers thread from last year.<P>Jim<P>Go Vikes!<BR>RIP Korey Stringer||||reg||1
