Z||000002||RiceCooker||08-16-2001||04:57 PM||||Yeah, I was gonna Start "Oh Those Tricky Buccaneers II" this afternoon but i suppose that is a little biased even considering they are the best team in the business.<P>I would just like to know how scared you all will be of the Bucs front four this year. <BR>Warren Sapp, lost 30 lbs down to 298 will be chasing Mark Gastineau's single season record of 22 sacks<BR>Marcus Jones breakthru last year of 10 Sacks, signed a long term deal<BR>Anthony (Booger) McFarland 3rd year player (Florida state?) who is in the same body mold as Sapp and actually beat him in a race (scary)<BR>Simeon Rice only getting paid 1 mil this season, next year his pay goes up to 5.25 mil if the bucs keep him. If that's not incentive to play well, i dont know what isnt.<P>Week 1 should be fun  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> We'll be in big D beating up on the cowpatties and showing Quincy Carter what the NFL is really like<P>||||reg||1
