Z||000015||Black88GT||08-16-2001||09:03 PM||||Brad Johnson/Rob Johnson, whats the difference? They both suck. <P>I would love to sit here and say the Ravens will definitely repeat but my confidence has been broken a little with the 2 big injuries.  With Jamal Lewis and Grbac they would have been awesome.  I'm not so sure about Terry Allen, we need a power back who can muscle through the line to get a first down on 3rd and 2.  Terry Allen is more of a run to the outside and out of bounds back.  Oh well, I still think the Playoffs are definite but I am not so sure about a guaranteed Super Bowl.  Of course the bandwagon Ravens fans expect a 16-0 season, once they lose I can hear them now "I thought the Ravens were supposed to be good again, I am selling my tickets since they suck" &lt;sigh&gt;<P>Did anyone watch Hard Knocks?  Billick was PISSED about the field condition.  I can't blame him, there was a divet in the field where they put a piece of wood and dirt down to cover it up.  Did they think the Ravens/Eagles wouldn't notice? Man Billick was mad!<P>I can't wait for opening day!<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Black88GT (edited 08-16-2001).]||||reg||1
